.TITLE "scutil"

.DIV "DESCRIPTION"
Manages system configuration and the dynamic store. it is used to retrieve and set system parameters like __HostName__, __ComputerName__, and __DNS__ configurations.

.DIV "TLDR"
**scutil --get HostName**
Retrieves the current network hostname of the system.
> __--get__ retrieval flag | __HostName__ parameter name

**scutil --set HostName "newname"**
Changes the system hostname to a new value.
> __--set__ modification flag | __HostName__ parameter name | __"newname"__ the new name

**scutil --dns**
Displays the current DNS configuration as understood by the system resolver.
> __--dns__ DNS info flag

**scutil --get ComputerName**
Prints the user-friendly computer name shown in the Sharing preferences.
> __--get__ retrieval flag | __ComputerName__ parameter name

.DIV "SUMMARY"
Changing the __HostName__ with __scutil__ is the most direct way to ensure your terminal prompt reflects the correct name across reboots.

.DIV "SEE ALSO"
**mac:networksetup** **linux:uname**

